# claude: the root .gitignore's broad "_*"/"*.o"/"*.d"/"*.sym"/"*.asm"
# patterns already cover most of this directory's own build output, but
# not these specific bare names - scoped here, not at the repo root,
# since "fs.img" also exists as ../kernel/fs.img, the copy of it the
# kernel embeds - which is itself generated, not checked in; see that
# fork-level .gitignore's own comment.
/fs.img
/mkfs
/initcode
/initcode.out
